      "formatted_phone_number": "773 144 377",
      "reviews": [
        {
          "author_name": "ILYA KACHKO",
          "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111144733228455525435/reviews",
          "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2eEjITj4d4tE54EFS1Yg_-nBRgH5DE2fp2h6qo9QxN8bTEb4T=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "One of the best kebabs in the city. My colleagues and I have been coming here every Tuesday since 2022 for many years, and it's become a real tradition for us.\nOverall, the selection and recipes are excellent. I also love the pleasant and friendly atmosphere. The staff are simply great!\nThe only thing is, I've recently started to notice that the portions have gotten smaller, even though the prices have gone up slightly. This is especially noticeable when compared to what the kebabs were like back in 2022 :)\nIt would be great if they kept the recipe but brought back those legendary large kebabs. Your loyal customers will be truly grateful for that ❤️",
          "time": 1771318408
        },
        {
          "author_name": "Robert S",
          "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116425338648607989964/reviews",
          "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJmcrbPLJb1AigzO3AIcQwDOH--uWUmNUa9r7zWp3rMkDIrfg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
          "rating": 4,
          "text": "The best kebab in town — we’ve been coming here with colleagues every Tuesday for years, and it’s become a cherished ritual.\nRecently, however, we’ve noticed the kebabs have become noticeably smaller, despite a slight price increase. It’s hard not to notice, compared to what we’ve grown used to over the years.\nDear Don’s, please bring back the glory days of the truly monstrous kebabs. Your long-time, loyal customers would greatly appreciate it.",
          "time": 1771316360
        }
